# Dependencies
node_modules/

# Build output
dist/

# Derived SQLite index — rebuildable from curated JSON, never authoritative.
# Must not be committed: curated JSON is the source of truth (P1-FINAL §13.2).
*.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
.cache/

# OS noise
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Editor
.vscode/
.idea/

# Local environment / config overrides. Phase 1 takes all paths through typed
# config, so a local override file must never be required for tests to pass.
.env
.env.local
phase1-config.local.json

# ⚠ The research corpus. UNTRACKED BY RULING (BP-1) — this line makes that
# ruling enforceable rather than aspirational (MB-5, docs/builder-master-decision-log.md).
# Without it the whole 24 MB tree is untracked AND unignored, so a single
# `git add -A` stages a real Figma file key, ~2,000 real node ids, real
# variable/style keys and screenshots of the client's live canvas onto a branch
# whose remote resolves WITHOUT AUTHENTICATION. BP-5 calls that the load-bearing
# risk, not a cautious one. This line is working-tree-only, exactly like the two
# below it: it changes nothing about the committed tree, and the two file-level
# rules that follow are left as the owner wrote them.
plugin_explore_phase/

# Nothing is selectively un-ignored beneath that line, and nothing can be: git
# does not re-include a file inside an ignored directory, so a negation here
# would be inert. Two file-level rules naming the raw Figma exports used to sit
# here; they were removed because the directory rule above already covers them
# and their filenames embed a real node id, which BP-5 forbids a tracked file
# from carrying. The exports themselves stay out of the tree — they are large,
# regenerable, and already recorded by SHA-256 in the research contract's
# provenance.exportsUsed, which is the durable reference to their content.

# Local-only working files — session-local, never committed (owner decision, 2026-09-06)
# CLAUDE.md      standing project instructions for the executing session
# AGENT-CHANNEL.md  the EXEC<->REVIEW thread; untracked by design, so it has NO git history
#                   -> never `git clean -fd` or `git stash -u` in this repo: both delete it
CLAUDE.md
AGENT-CHANNEL.md
